+0.00060                      				# radiation coefficient for ice_max  (for method 2/12)
+0.00006                       				# radiation coefficient for snow_min (for method 2/12)
+0.00050                     				# radiation coefficient for snow_max (for method 2/12)
10   							# els-konstante for ice
120  							# els-konstante for firn
24   							# els-konstante for snow
